Value VLAN_ID (\d+)
Value MAC_ADDRESS ([0-9a-fA-F]{4}\.[0-9a-fA-F]{4}\.[0-9a-fA-F]{4}|[0-9a-fA-F:-]{12,17})
Value TYPE (\S+)
Value INTERFACE (\S+)
Value STATE (\S+)
Value FLAG (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*VLAN\s+MAC\s+TYPE\s+INTERFACE\s+STATE\s+FLAG
  ^\s*${VLAN_ID}\s+${MAC_ADDRESS}\s+${TYPE}\s+${INTERFACE}\s+${STATE}\s+${FLAG}\s*$$ -> Record
